    18  // `isStreaming` is still true, so the MessageEditor renders the Abort button
    19  // and never re-renders. We force a follow-up render once `waitForIdle()`
    20  // resolves (post-finishRun), at which point `isStreaming` is false and the
    21  // Send button comes back.
    22  export function subscribeAgentEvents(agent: Agent, panel: AgentPanelLike) {
    23    // `animate` writes its HTML as a tool argument, so the authored source is
    24    // available token by token. Accumulate it and publish partial renders the
